[311.044, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ **Step 3 report: Depth**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Did**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Official pricing pages:** I fetched Wave, FreshBooks and Invoice Ninja directly instead of relying on\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  review sites.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Real tools:** I ran `puppeteer-core` driving Chrome at 320, 390, 768 and 1280px in light and dark mode.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  I also ran axe-core for accessibility and a script that checks the page's own arithmetic. These tools live\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  in `.ambition/tools/`.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Fixes and additions:** the fixes are listed below, plus a favicon, a theme color and structured pricing\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  data (JSON-LD).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Found**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Competitor prices:** the official pages match the earlier figures.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Wave Pro is $19, and its Starter plan has unlimited invoices.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - FreshBooks is $23 / $43 / $70.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Invoice Ninja's free plan allows 5 clients, and Pro is $14 with unlimited clients.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - I didn't fetch Bonsai's official page, so its numbers are still unverified.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Your own numbers:** the yearly totals are exact (20% off, $144 and $336), and the fee examples are right\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  ($29.30 on cards, $5 cap on bank transfers).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Overflow and contrast:** there was no horizontal overflow at any width and no contrast failures.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Accessibility issues:** axe flagged two. The plan names skipped a heading level, and the scrollable\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  comparison table couldn't be reached by keyboard.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Changed**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Fixed both axe issues:** axe now reports 0 violations at 390 and 1280px in both light and dark mode.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Starter raised to 5 active clients** (it was 3), so it's no stingier than Invoice Ninja's free tier. The\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  selector, table, FAQ and meta text now say 1–5 / 6–25 / 26+.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Selector announcements:** the client-count selector is now announced to screen readers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Still open**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Rendering:** I looked at the final top-of-page render in light mode only. Dark mode was last visually\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  checked before the check-icon fix, and I verified it afterwards with the audit rather than by eye.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Bonsai:** its pricing is still unverified.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Snapshot folder:** I had already saved a copy to `.ambition/steps/3/` earlier by mistake. It's now\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  overwritten with the final step-3 version.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
