[470.653, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 6/8 · Judge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  I'm building an acceptance test that isn't me: a script that turns the original ask and every promise from\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the restatement into assertions. It runs in real Chrome against both the first version and the final, so the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  comparison is on the same check.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
