[580.012, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 7/8 · Stretch\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **The stretch target**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **My brief and fallback:** the page works as it stands. A visitor finds their plan in a few seconds, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  the Solo button is above the fold at the common desktop sizes. This version passes 39 of 39 checks and is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  saved in `.ambition/steps/6/`.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Stretch:** a visitor needs no scrolling at all to decide.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    1. **Desktop:** at 1366×640 the first screen shows all three plans, the prices, the buttons and all three\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  objection answers (lock-in, fees, export) in the recommended plan's card.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    2. **Small phone:** at 375×667 the Solo button is above the fold, which it misses today.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  First I'll measure how far off the first screen is.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
