[659.063, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ **Step 7 report: Stretch**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Did:** I set a target harder than the brief. The brief was a plan found in a few seconds with the button\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  above the fold. The stretch was no scrolling at all to decide:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **1366×640 desktop:** all three plans, prices and buttons, plus all three objection answers (lock-in,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  fees, export) in the recommended card.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **375×667 small phone:** the Solo button above the fold.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  I built `.ambition/tools/stretch.mjs` to measure it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Found**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Starting point:** the desktop first screen was 123px too tall. The small phone was 26px over.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Result:** the stretch is met at 1366×640, 1280×720, 375×667 and 390×844. The full acceptance test still\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  passes 39 of 39, and I looked at the first screens at both target sizes.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Compression:** it came from tighter hero spacing, a smaller headline, a hidden subheading on phones,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  tighter cards and shorter objection lines.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Changed course**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Alignment:** my first compression left the Starter card's objection lines higher than the other cards. I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  fixed that.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Export wording:** the acceptance test caught that I'd removed the word \"export\" from Pro's data line. I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  restored it and moved \"API access\" into Pro's feature list.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Where it broke or cost something**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Lost wording:** the cards no longer say \"even after you cancel\" or \"drop back to Starter\". The cards now\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  just say \"Take your data. CSV & PDF export.\" Those details live only in the FAQ.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Hidden subheading:** the subheading is hidden below 860px width, so tablets and phones lose that one\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  line.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Plan name layout:** the plan name and its \"who it's for\" line still sit on two lines. My attempt to put\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  them on one row didn't take effect, and the target was met without it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Still open:** the processor fee rates remain unverified.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The step-7 snapshot is in `.ambition/steps/7/`. The previous version, before this step, is in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  `.ambition/steps/6/`.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
